# __BIN__

[![ci](https://github.com/Bam679/__REPO__/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg)](https://github.com/Bam679/__REPO__/actions/workflows/ci.yml)
[![OpenSSF Scorecard](https://api.scorecard.dev/projects/github.com/Bam679/__REPO__/badge)](https://scorecard.dev/viewer/?uri=github.com/Bam679/__REPO__)
[![release](https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/Bam679/__REPO__)](https://github.com/Bam679/__REPO__/releases)

**__TITLE__ for AI coding agents.** A small, dependency-free Go CLI with compact, machine-readable output. It is **read-only by default**, and writes must be allowed by a policy file that the binary enforces. It also ships as a Claude Code plugin with a skill that teaches agents how to use it.

Part of the agent-cli family: [apple-mail](https://github.com/Bam679/apple-mail-cli) · [apple-notes](https://github.com/Bam679/apple-notes-cli) · [apple-calendar](https://github.com/Bam679/apple-calendar-cli) · [apple-reminders](https://github.com/Bam679/apple-reminders-cli) · [paperless](https://github.com/Bam679/paperless-cli). All of them are available from one marketplace: [agent-cli-plugins](https://github.com/Bam679/agent-cli-plugins).

## Install

**Binary** (__PLATFORMS__): download from [Releases](https://github.com/Bam679/__REPO__/releases), verify it, and put it on your `PATH`:

```sh
V=0.1.0; OS=__EXAMPLE_OS__; ARCH=arm64
curl -fsSLO https://github.com/Bam679/__REPO__/releases/download/v$V/__BIN___${V}_${OS}_${ARCH}.tar.gz
curl -fsSLO https://github.com/Bam679/__REPO__/releases/download/v$V/checksums.txt
curl -fsSLO https://github.com/Bam679/__REPO__/releases/download/v$V/checksums.txt.sigstore.json
cosign verify-blob --bundle checksums.txt.sigstore.json \
  --certificate-identity-regexp '^https://github.com/Bam679/__REPO__/' \
  --certificate-oidc-issuer https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com checksums.txt
shasum -a 256 --ignore-missing -c checksums.txt
gh attestation verify __BIN___${V}_${OS}_${ARCH}.tar.gz --repo Bam679/__REPO__   # SLSA provenance
tar xzf __BIN___${V}_${OS}_${ARCH}.tar.gz __BIN__ && install -m 755 __BIN__ ~/.local/bin/
```

**From source:** `go install github.com/Bam679/__REPO__/cmd/__BIN__@latest`

**Claude Code plugin** (skill + guard hook). Install it from one source only:

```sh
# just this CLI
claude plugin marketplace add Bam679/__REPO__
claude plugin install __BIN__@__REPO__
# or everything, including the shared agent-cli skill
claude plugin marketplace add Bam679/agent-cli-plugins
claude plugin install __BIN__@agent-cli-plugins
```

